# The transverse grid changes the supermodes slightly, and with them the coupling length.
# Reference: the same propagation stepped independently in NumPy.
title Coupler on a 12.5 nm transverse grid
grid dx=0.0125 dz=0.25
window width=14 length=20
guide straight x=-0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=20
guide straight x=0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=20
launch mode x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor bar z=20 x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor cross z=20 x=0.35 width=0.5
expect power bar 0.003581549 2e-7
expect power cross 0.997591306 2e-7
expect neff 2.643404380 2e-8
